        <mxCell id="n17" value="reply 才显示学生对话，并携带投递后 state；suppressed 记录取消或等待的具体原因。" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;fontFamily=PingFang SC;fontColor=#17304F;fillColor=#FFF6DF;strokeColor=#CFB46C;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
